cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Anneal, please cite it as below."
title: "Anneal: measured, hardware-aware INT8 quantization for edge AI"
abstract: >-
  Standard INT8 quantization breaks gated-depthwise networks (EfficientNet, MobileNetV3, LCNet,
  MobileViT) on the default INT8 path of Qualcomm, TI, AMD and NVIDIA toolchains. Anneal fixes it
  with an exact channel equalisation through SiLU/Hardswish gates, without retraining, and
  measures every result with paired statistics.
authors:
